    "source": {
      "value": "crb"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "This twisted and grim-looking staff is adorned with hideous skull and bone motifs. While wielding the staff, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to checks to identify necromancy magic.\n\nYou expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.\n\n- **Cantrip** chill touch\n- **1st** grim tendrils, ray of enfeeblement\n- **2nd** deafness, gentle repose"
